      "evidence": "Exactly protocol commit 4b5fec78f02825d34b15276292fef804607e375e contracts/Market.sol declares the selected borrow, repay, and fixed-maturity methods and overrides inherited withdraw/redeem. It imports ERC4626 from solmate/src/mixins/ERC4626.sol. This source declaration is not per-market runtime-code proof."
