      "evidence": "Exactly Market imports Solmate ERC4626. The upstream v7 source URL was fetched and declares deposit(uint256 assets,address receiver) returns(uint256 shares) and mint(uint256 shares,address receiver) returns(uint256 assets). `git ls-remote` did not return a v7 tag object; the tag is recorded as the source reference without claiming an independently resolved commit SHA."
